%% source [LQ/lexical §4.2]
%% entry read
%% input
CALL violations(merge/main/from/lane/l10) YIELD key
%% tokens
KW CALL
NAME violations
P (
REF merge/main/from/lane/l10
P )
KW YIELD
NAME key
EOF -
%% end

